	(text "Cores: Micrometals T30-2 (red, F2/F3) and T30-6 (yellow, F4/F5) from Kits and Parts (kitsandparts.com).\nTurns = passes through the core centre. AL 4.3 nH/t^2 (-2), 3.6 nH/t^2 (-6), +/-5%%.\nF5 has few turns: tune each toroid by spreading or compressing turns. Mount toroids vertically.\nRated for 1 W output max. All filter caps 0603 C0G/NP0 50 V; parallel parts sum to the design value." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "766837bd-29f5-4174-8cbc-d89a1edb527e"))
